    "Almost all player text is vanilla $tokens passed to Localization.Localize; only the mod's own English is here.",
    "texts: default fuzzy clock words (config Info - Clock/Time fuzzy words, shown via TMP_Text.SetText when Time type = Fuzzy) and the default in-world ping text passed to Localize.",
